Inspect the file: cat /etc/apt/sources.list.d/google-cloud-sdk.list â it must be a single unbroken line starting with deb; delete the file with sudo rm /etc/apt/sources.list.d/google-cloud-sdk.list and recreate it using the heredoc form shown in the shell safety rules.
